  "content": "<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/uHWfIHb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"965\" height=\"516\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>经典模组<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/better-than-bunnies/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Than Bunnies</a>的骄傲继承者现已降临！优雅羊驼将让您的世界焕发时尚光彩！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/PPQP2lV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"965\" height=\"516\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>当然包含土耳其毡帽与卷曲八字胡。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>模型部分由<a href=\"https://twitter.com/RazzleberryFox\" rel=\"nofollow\">RazzleberryFox</a>授权制作。可单独禁用服饰组件，羊驼的时尚度将随机生成，带来千变万化的造型可能！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本模组仅需客户端安装。需要<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Forge</a>运行。Fabric版本请前往<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-than-llamas-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>获取。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Wyld/status/846489501320982528\" rel=\"nofollow\">#都怪Wyld</a></p>",
